# Compuvac sits on Gentoo's desktop profile so most packages come prebuilt from Gentoo's
# binary host. What makes it Compuvac is what runs, not what's compiled in: no systemd,
# no OpenRC, no session daemons (seatd is the only seat arbiter), one program on screen.
USE="-systemd seatd alsa"
INPUT_DEVICES="libinput"
